  "Description": "This module exploits a vulnerability in Tectia SSH server for Unix-based platforms. The bug is caused by a SSH2_MSG_USERAUTH_PASSWD_CHANGEREQ request before password authentication, allowing any remote user to bypass the login routine, and then gain access as root.",
